// ---- joined text: a def like any other. The defs above wrap it (say, is, ...);
// the ones below run inside it, so  say n " x 7 = " n * 7  joins n, " x 7 = " and (n * 7)

// Text and values next to each other join into one text.
// Example: "x = " 2
//          → "x = 2"
python A0 "A1" A2
python "A0" A1
python A0 "A1"
    return "".join(as_text(value) for value in a)
